{"suttaId":"tha-ap57","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[4049,4079],"vripara":"33"},"segments":{"tha-ap57:0.3":"Opavayhattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap57:1.1":"“Padumuttarabuddhassa, ājānīyamadāsahaṃ;","tha-ap57:1.3":"Niyyādetvāna sambuddhe [sambuddhaṃ (sī. ka.)], agamāsiṃ sakaṃ gharaṃ.","tha-ap57:2.1":"“Devalo nāma nāmena, satthuno aggasāvako;","tha-ap57:2.3":"Varadhammassa dāyādo, āgacchi mama santikaṃ.","tha-ap57:3.1":"“Sapattabhāro bhagavā, ājāneyyo na kappati;","tha-ap57:3.3":"Tava saṅkappamaññāya, adhivāsesi cakkhumā.","tha-ap57:4.1":"“Agghāpetvā vātajavaṃ, sindhavaṃ sīghavāhanaṃ;","tha-ap57:4.3":"Padumuttarabuddhassa, khamanīyamadāsahaṃ.","tha-ap57:5.1":"“Yaṃ yaṃ yonupapajjāmi, devattaṃ atha mānusaṃ [deve ca mānuse bhave (sī. ka.)];","tha-ap57:5.3":"Khamanīyaṃ vātajavaṃ, cittaṃ nibbattate [ājānīyā vātajavā, vitti nibbattare (syā.), khamanīyā vātajavā, cittā nibbattare (sī.)] mama.","tha-ap57:6.1":"“Lābhaṃ tesaṃ suladdhaṃva, ye labhantupasampadaṃ;","tha-ap57:6.3":"Punapi payirupāseyyaṃ, buddho loke sace bhave.","tha-ap57:7.1":"“Aṭṭhavīsatikkhattuṃhaṃ, rājā āsiṃ mahabbalo;","tha-ap57:7.3":"Cāturanto vijitāvī, jambusaṇḍassa [jambudīpassa (syā.), jambumaṇḍassa (ka.)] jambuissaro.","tha-ap57:8.1":"“Idaṃ pacchimakaṃ mayhaṃ, carimo vattate bhavo;","tha-ap57:8.3":"Pattosmi acalaṃ ṭhānaṃ, hitvā jayaparājayaṃ.","tha-ap57:9.1":"“Catutiṃsasahassamhi, mahātejosi khattiyo;","tha-ap57:9.3":"Sataratanasampanno, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap57:10.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap57:11.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā opavayho thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap57:12.1":"Opavayhattherassāpadānaṃ pañcamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2571,"to":2574,"paras":[{"para":2571,"vripara":"33","refs":["tha-ap57:1"],"lines":["So “kena nu kho kāraṇena idaṃ mayā santipadaṃ adhigatan”ti upadhārento pubbakammaṃ ñāṇena paccakkhato ñatvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ udānavasena pakāsento <b>padumuttarabuddhassā</b>tiādimāha.","Taṃ vuttatthameva.","<b>Ājānīyamadāsahan</b>ti ājānīyaṃ uttamajātisindhavaṃ ahaṃ adāsiṃ pūjesinti attho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap57:1"],["tha-ap57:1"],["tha-ap57:1"]]},{"para":2572,"vripara":"35","refs":["tha-ap57:3"],"lines":["<b>Sapattabhāro</b>ti sassa attano pattāni aṭṭha parikkhārāni bhārāni yassa so sapattabhāro, aṭṭhaparikkhārayuttoti attho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap57:3"]]},{"para":2573,"vripara":"36","refs":["tha-ap57:4"],"lines":["<b>Khamanīyamadāsahan</b>ti khamanīyayoggaṃ cīvarādikappiyaparikkhāranti attho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap57:4"]]},{"para":2574,"vripara":"40","refs":["tha-ap57:8"],"lines":["<b>Carimo</b>ti pariyosāno koṭippatto bhavoti attho.","Sesaṃ suviññeyyamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap57:8"],["tha-ap57:8"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap57:1.1","padumuttarabuddhassā",0,0],["tha-ap57:1.1","ājānīyamadāsahaṃ",0,2],["tha-ap57:3.1","sapattabhāro",1,0],["tha-ap57:4.3","khamanīyamadāsahaṃ",2,0],["tha-ap57:8.1","carimo",3,0]]},"tika":null}
